OL,3,GNEWSACafe serving up second chances
OL,4,Asays it curbs reoffending
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity cafe that gives jobs to
OL,7,Fpeople leaving prison - and which
OL,8,Fturned five at the weekend - says being
OL,9,Fgiven employment can reduce the chance
OL,10,Fof criminals reoffending.
OL,12,FCafe 16, based in Newcastle Cathedral
OL,13,Fand run by Morpeth-based charity The
OL,14,FOswin Project, has helped 64 prison
OL,15,Fleavers into work since it opened in
OL,16,F2021.
OL,18,FAbout 37% of people sentenced to prison
OL,19,For a court order in England and Wales
OL,20,Freoffend, with the highest rates of
OL,21,Freoffending in the North East,
OL,22,Faccording to government statistics.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
