OL,3,GNEWSACafe serving up second chances
OL,4,Asays it curbs reoffending
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut charity founder Fiona Sample said
OL,7,Fonly 3% of the prisoners they had
OL,8,Fsupported had reoffended, adding: "They
OL,9,Fare grateful, they are focused, and
OL,10,Fthey are determined to prove
OL,11,Fthemselves".
